Kept out of `nros configure`: the contract states the RFC's 70 ms
take-authority deadline and the design misses it (two `level-within`
errors, docs/l4-island.md), so the resolver refuses the model and
configure would fail the whole workspace. .github/check-contracts.sh still
checks it, expecting those errors. Remove this file when the finding is
resolved or an L4 image is built.
